      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This seems to be a new kind of exploit. I don't know how it works but my guess is they're embedding invalid data into the avatar thumbnails, causing VRChat to slowdown and crash for many computers. To some with powerful PCs it only appears as lag for a couple of seconds.\n\nSaw several VRChat Streamers on Twitch being targeted by this today.\n\nEnabling streamer mode blocks friend requests and prevents it until a patch is released.",
